      "created_at": "2014-08-18T07:37:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>My group and I are wondering - how many Impaling Structures can Absolute Zero have in play at once?&nbsp; We went with one set; if AZ uses the power again in a later turn, the previous set is removed and the new set is placed down.&nbsp; It seemed like the board could get a pretty large number of Impaling Structures on it otherwise.&nbsp; :)&nbsp;</p><p>Is there an official ruling on this?&nbsp; What have others (especially playtesters!) been doing for this?</p><p>thanks in advance,</p><p>c86</p>",
