      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-24T04:21:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In general, how can we tell what tokens created by powers are removed with their card and which stay? &nbsp;Is there errata for Impaling Structures or is there a general rule I am missing? &nbsp;For example, Citizen Dawn's \"Return with the Dawn\" specifically mentions that the Citizen is removed when the card is removed, but Impaling does not.</p>",
